id: pm-pllp78
title: "GH-1591: guarded terminal updates conflict with their own scalar write and misreport compensation"
description: "Sequential timestamp-guarded SDK update persists scalar edits, then refuses its own terminal transition as upsert_match_changed while the journal reports compensated. Independently reproduced in an isolated current-build fixture on Node26.12.1."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
