risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
expected_result: One guarded SDK operation preserves stale-writer protection while accepting its own internal writes and reporting accurate transaction recovery state.
actual_result: upsert_match_changed exit4 leaves the changed title on an open item with newer updated_at; journal status is compensated with empty started/completed step arrays.
